Vou estruturar a tela como um dashboard operacional: navegação mais compacta, resumo imediato, ações principais, métricas sem repetição, módulos organizados e estado vazio claro. O código abaixo será autónomo, responsivo e com interações básicas já incluídas.Abaixo está uma versão completa e autónoma da interface, com uma composição mais limpa e funcional. Foram removidos o hero excessivo, textos longos, elementos repetidos, blocos pouco úteis e o rodapé exagerado. A estrutura agora prioriza indicadores, pendências, módulos e ações rápidas.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-AO">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#062c3d" />
  <title>SIGRE — Visão geral</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --coral: #ff5148;
      --coral-dark: #e8453d;
      --navy: #062c3d;
      --navy-light: #0d4055;
      --ink: #102d3c;
      --muted: #71808c;
      --soft-muted: #93a0aa;
      --canvas: #f5f7f8;
      --surface: #ffffff;
      --line: #e2e8eb;
      --line-dark: #cbd6dc;
      --success: #188565;
      --warning: #b77715;
      --danger: #c74742;
      --shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(16, 45, 60, 0.07);
      --shadow-heavy: 0 18px 42px rgba(16, 45, 60, 0.13);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-width: 320px;
      background: var(--canvas);
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    body.menu-open {
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    button,
    input,
    select {
      font: inherit;
    }

    button {
      border: 0;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    svg {
      width: 18px;
      height: 18px;
      stroke-width: 1.9;
    }

    .app-shell {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 248px minmax(0, 1fr);
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    /* Sidebar */
    .sidebar {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 30;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      height: 100vh;
      padding: 22px 16px 16px;
      color: #ffffff;
      background: var(--navy);
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 11px;
      padding: 0 9px;
    }

    .brand-mark {
      display: grid;
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      place-items: center;
      color: var(--navy);
      background: var(--coral);
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    .brand-mark svg {
      width: 21px;
      height: 21px;
    }

    .brand-name {
      display: block;
      font-size: 19px;
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .brand-subtitle {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 4px;
      color: #a9bec7;
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .workspace-card {
      margin: 30px 0 22px;
      padding: 14px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.13);
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    .workspace-label,
    .nav-label {
      display: block;
      color: #91aab5;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .workspace-title {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 6px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .workspace-meta {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 3px;
      color: #aac0c8;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .nav-label {
      margin: 0 10px 8px;
    }

    .primary-nav {
      display: grid;
      gap: 4px;
    }

    .nav-link {
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 11px;
      min-height: 44px;
      padding: 0 11px;
      color: #c5d4d9;
      border-radius: 7px;
      transition: background 160ms ease, color 160ms ease;
    }

    .nav-link:hover {
      color: #ffffff;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    }

    .nav-link.active {
      color: var(--navy);
      background: #ffffff;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .nav-link.active::before {
      position: absolute;
      left: -16px;
      width: 3px;
      height: 24px;
      background: var(--coral);
      content: "";
      border-radius: 0 3px 3px 0;
    }

    .nav-link svg {
      flex: 0 0 auto;
    }

    .nav-badge {
      display: inline-grid;
      min-width: 21px;
      height: 21px;
      margin-left: auto;
      padding: 0 5px;
      place-items: center;
      color: #ffffff;
      background: var(--coral);
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .sidebar-footer {
      margin-top: auto;
    }

    .support-link {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 12px 10px;
      color: #c5d4d9;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .support-link:hover {
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .sidebar-user {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 8px;
      padding: 12px 10px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    }

    .avatar {
      display: grid;
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
      place-items: center;
      color: var(--navy);
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 50%;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .sidebar-user strong,
    .sidebar-user small {
      display: block;
    }

    .sidebar-user strong {
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .sidebar-user small {
      margin-top: 2px;
      color: #9fb5bd;
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    /* Main area */
    .main-shell {
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .topbar {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 20;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      min-height: 72px;
      padding: 0 38px;
      background: var(--surface);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .topbar-left,
    .topbar-actions,
    .breadcrumbs,
    .profile-trigger,
    .status-pill {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .topbar-left {
      gap: 14px;
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .breadcrumbs {
      gap: 8px;
      color: var(--soft-muted);
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .breadcrumbs strong {
      color: var(--ink);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .breadcrumbs svg {
      width: 15px;
      height: 15px;
    }

    .topbar-actions {
      position: relative;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .status-pill {
      gap: 7px;
      min-height: 34px;
      padding: 0 12px;
      color: var(--coral-dark);
      background: #fff3f1;
      border: 1px solid #ffd2cd;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .status-pill svg {
      width: 15px;
      height: 15px;
    }

    .status-counter {
      display: inline-grid;
      min-width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
      place-items: center;
      color: #ffffff;
      background: var(--coral);
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .icon-button {
      position: relative;
      display: inline-grid;
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      place-items: center;
      color: var(--muted);
      background: transparent;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      border-radius: 7px;
      transition: color 160ms ease, background 160ms ease, border-color 160ms ease;
    }

    .icon-button:hover {
      color: var(--navy);
      background: #f1f5f6;
      border-color: var(--line);
    }

    .notification-dot {
      position: absolute;
      top: 7px;
      right: 7px;
      width: 7px;
      height: 7px;
      background: var(--coral);
      border: 2px solid #ffffff;
      border-radius: 50%;
    }

    .profile-trigger {
      gap: 9px;
      min-height: 40px;
      padding: 4px 8px 4px 5px;
      color: var(--navy);
      background: #f4f7f8;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 999px;
    }

    .profile-trigger .avatar {
      width: 30px;
      height: 30px;
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .profile-copy {
      display: grid;
      text-align: left;
      line-height: 1.15;
    }

    .profile-copy strong {
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .profile-copy small {
      margin-top: 3px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 10px;
    }

    .profile-trigger > svg {
      width: 15px;
      height: 15px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .popover {
      position: absolute;
      top: calc(100% + 10px);
      z-index: 50;
      width: 280px;
      padding: 8px;
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-heavy);
    }

    #notificationsPanel {
      right: 48px;
    }

    #profilePanel {
      right: 0;
      width: 220px;
    }

    .popover-header {
      padding: 9px 10px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .popover-header strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .popover-header small {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 2px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .popover-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 10px;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 11px 10px;
      color: var(--ink);
      text-align: left;
      background: transparent;
      border-radius: 6px;
    }

    .popover-item:hover {
      background: #f4f7f8;
    }

    .popover-item svg {
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      margin-top: 2px;
      color: var(--coral);
    }

    .popover-item strong,
    .popover-item small {
      display: block;
    }

    .popover-item strong {
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .popover-item small {
      margin-top: 2px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .mobile-menu {
      display: none;
    }

    /* Content */
    .content {
      width: min(100% - 64px, 1240px);
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 34px 0 48px;
    }

    .page-intro {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-end;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: block;
      color: #728da0;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .page-intro h1 {
      margin: 7px 0 5px;
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 34px;
      line-height: 1.1;
      letter-spacing: 0;
    }

    .page-intro p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .page-meta {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .sync-dot {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      background: var(--success);
      border-radius: 50%;
    }

    .hero-panel {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(280px, 0.9fr);
      min-height: 238px;
      margin-top: 28px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--navy);
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .hero-copy {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 32px 36px;
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .hero-copy .eyebrow {
      color: #9ec0cc;
    }

    .hero-copy h2 {
      max-width: 470px;
      margin: 9px 0 8px;
      font-size: 27px;
      line-height: 1.15;
    }

    .hero-copy p {
      max-width: 460px;
      margin: 0;
      color: #bfd1d7;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 9px;
      margin-top: 22px;
    }

    .hero-media {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 238px;
      background: #dbe3e5;
    }

    .hero-media::after {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(6, 44, 61, 0.28), transparent 45%);
      content: "";
    }

    .hero-media img {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      min-height: 238px;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      min-height: 38px;
      padding: 0 14px;
      border-radius: 7px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      transition: background 160ms ease, color 160ms ease, border-color 160ms ease;
    }

    .button svg {
      width: 16px;
      height: 16px;
    }

    .button-primary {
      color: #ffffff;
      background: var(--coral);
    }

    .button-primary:hover {
      background: var(--coral-dark);
    }

    .button-light {
      color: var(--navy);
      background: #ffffff;
    }

    .button-light:hover {
      background: #eaf0f2;
    }

    .button-outline {
      color: var(--navy);
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid var(--line-dark);
    }

    .button-outline:hover {
      border-color: var(--navy);
    }

    .button-ghost {
      color: #d7e4e8;
      background: transparent;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28);
    }

    .button-ghost:hover {
      color: #ffffff;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    }

    .section {
      margin-top: 38px;
    }

    .section-heading,
    .panel-heading {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-end;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .section-heading h2,
    .panel-heading h2 {
      margin: 5px 0 0;
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 20px;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .text-button {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 7px;
      padding: 4px 0;
      color: var(--navy);
      background: transparent;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .text-button:hover {
      color: var(--coral-dark);
    }

    .text-button svg {
      width: 15px;
      height: 15px;
    }

    .metrics-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .metric-card {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      min-height: 144px;
      padding: 18px;
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(16, 45, 60, 0.025);
    }

    .metric-card.primary {
      color: #ffffff;
      background: var(--navy);
      border-color: var(--navy);
    }

    .metric-top,
    .metric-bottom {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .metric-top {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .metric-card.primary .metric-top,
    .metric-card.primary .metric-bottom {
      color: #a8c0c8;
    }

    .metric-icon {
      display: grid;
      width: 30px;
      height: 30px;
      place-items: center;
      color: var(--navy);
      background: #edf3f5;
      border-radius: 7px;
    }

    .metric-icon svg {
      width: 16px;
      height: 16px;
    }

    .metric-card.primary .metric-icon {
      color: #ffffff;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    }

    .metric-value {
      margin-top: 12px;
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .metric-card.primary .metric-value {
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .metric-bottom {
      margin-top: 18px;
      padding-top: 12px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .metric-card.primary .metric-bottom {
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
    }

    .metric-status {
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .metric-card.primary .metric-status {
      color: #a8c0c8;
    }

    .metric-link {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 4px;
      color: var(--navy);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .metric-card.primary .metric-link {
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .metric-link svg {
      width: 14px;
      height: 14px;
    }

    .dashboard-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.45fr) minmax(300px, 0.85fr);
      gap: 16px;
      margin-top: 16px;
    }

    .panel {
      padding: 22px;
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(16, 45, 60, 0.025);
    }

    .panel-heading {
      align-items: flex-start;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .panel-heading .icon-button {
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
    }

    .network-summary {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
      padding-bottom: 18px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .summary-number {
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 30px;
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .summary-number span {
      margin-left: 5px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .state-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      min-height: 28px;
      padding: 0 9px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .state-badge.warning {
      color: var(--warning);
      background: #fff6e5;
    }

    .state-badge.success {
      color: var(--success);
      background: #eaf8f2;
    }

    .state-badge.neutral {
      color: var(--muted);
      background: #f0f3f4;
    }

    .state-badge svg {
      width: 14px;
      height: 14px;
    }

    .progress-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 17px;
      padding-top: 20px;
    }

    .progress-row {
      display: grid;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .progress-label {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .progress-label strong {
      color: var(--ink);
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .progress-track {
      width: 100%;
      height: 7px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #edf1f2;
      border-radius: 999px;
    }

    .progress-value {
      height: 100%;
      background: var(--coral);
      border-radius: inherit;
    }

    .progress-value.green {
      background: var(--success);
    }

    .progress-value.gray {
      background: #b9c4c9;
    }

    .quick-actions {
      display: grid;
      gap: 0;
    }

    .action-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 13px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .action-row:first-child {
      padding-top: 0;
    }

    .action-row:last-child {
      padding-bottom: 0;
      border-bottom: 0;
    }

    .action-icon {
      display: grid;
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      place-items: center;
      color: var(--navy);
      background: #edf3f5;
      border-radius: 7px;
    }

    .action-copy {
      min-width: 0;
      flex: 1;
    }

    .action-copy strong,
    .action-copy small {
      display: block;
    }

    .action-copy strong {
      color: var(--ink);
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .action-copy small {
      margin-top: 2px;
      overflow: hidden;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11px;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .action-arrow {
      display: grid;
      width: 30px;
      height: 30px;
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      place-items: center;
      color: var(--navy);
      background: #f2f5f6;
      border-radius: 7px;
    }

    .action-arrow:hover {
      color: #ffffff;
      background: var(--coral);
    }

    .action-arrow svg {
      width: 15px;
      height: 15px;
    }

    .module-list {
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    .module-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto auto;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 15px;
      padding: 16px 18px;
    }

    .module-row + .module-row {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .module-icon {
      display: grid;
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      place-items: center;
      color: var(--navy);
      background: #edf3f5;
      border-radius: 7px;
    }

    .module-copy {
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .module-copy strong,
    .module-copy small {
      display: block;
    }

    .module-copy strong {
      color: var(--ink);
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .module-copy small {
      margin-top: 3px;
      overflow: hidden;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11px;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .module-action {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .module-action:hover {
      color: var(--coral-dark);
    }

    .module-action svg {
      width: 15px;
      height: 15px;
    }

    .split-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .activity-list,
    .report-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 0;
    }

    .activity-item,
    .report-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 13px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .activity-item:first-child,
    .report-item:first-child {
      padding-top: 0;
    }

    .activity-item:last-child,
    .report-item:last-child {
      padding-bottom: 0;
      border-bottom: 0;
    }

    .activity-marker {
      display: grid;
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      place-items: center;
      color: var(--navy);
      background: #eef4f6;
      border-radius: 50%;
    }

    .activity-copy,
    .report-copy {
      min-width: 0;
      flex: 1;
    }

    .activity-copy strong,
    .activity-copy small,
    .report-copy strong,
    .report-copy small {
      display: block;
    }

    .activity-copy strong,
    .report-copy strong {
      color: var(--ink);
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .activity-copy small,
    .report-copy small {
      margin-top: 2px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .empty-state {
      display: grid;
      min-height: 150px;
      padding: 20px;
      place-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      border: 1px dashed var(--line-dark);
      border-radius: 7px;
    }

    .empty-state svg {
      width: 27px;
      height: 27px;
      color: #8fa8b3;
    }

    .empty-state strong {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 9px;
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .empty-state p {
      max-width: 300px;
      margin: 4px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .report-item {
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .report-download {
      display: grid;
      width: 31px;
      height: 31px;
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      place-items: center;
      color: var(--navy);
      background: #f1f5f6;
      border-radius: 7px;
    }

    .report-download:hover {
      color: #ffffff;
      background: var(--coral);
    }

    .report-download svg {
      width: 15px;
      height: 15px;
    }

    /* Footer */
    .footer {
      color: #c1d0d5;
      background: var(--navy);
    }

    .footer-inner {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
      width: min(100% - 64px, 1240px);
      min-height: 86px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .footer-brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .footer-brand .brand-mark {
      width: 31px;
      height: 31px;
    }

    .footer-brand .brand-mark svg {
      width: 17px;
      height: 17px;
    }

    .footer-brand strong,
    .footer-brand small {
      display: block;
    }

    .footer-brand strong {
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .footer-brand small {
      margin-top: 2px;
      font-size: 10px;
    }

    .footer-links {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      gap: 16px;
      color: #c1d0d5;
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .footer-links a:hover {
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .toast {
      position: fixed;
      right: 24px;
      bottom: 24px;
      z-index: 100;
      max-width: 320px;
      padding: 13px 16px;
      color: #ffffff;
      background: var(--navy);
      border-left: 3px solid var(--coral);
      border-radius: 7px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-heavy);
      font-size: 12px;
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(12px);
      pointer-events: none;
      transition: opacity 180ms ease, transform 180ms ease;
    }

    .toast.visible {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }

    .is-loading svg {
      animation: spin 700ms linear infinite;
    }

    @keyframes spin {
      to {
        transform: rotate(360deg);
      }
    }

    .sidebar-overlay {
      display: none;
    }

    [hidden] {
      display: none !important;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1120px) {
      .topbar {
        padding: 0 26px;
      }

      .content,
      .footer-inner {
        width: min(100% - 48px, 1240px);
      }

      .metrics-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      }

      .hero-panel {
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(260px, 0.8fr);
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 860px) {
      .app-shell {
        display: block;
      }

      .sidebar {
        position: fixed;
        left: 0;
        width: 280px;
        transform: translateX(-100%);
        transition: transform 180ms ease;
      }

      .sidebar.is-open {
        transform: translateX(0);
      }

      .sidebar-overlay {
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        z-index: 25;
        display: block;
        background: rgba(6, 44, 61, 0.38);
        opacity: 0;
        pointer-events: none;
        transition: opacity 180ms ease;
      }

      .sidebar-overlay.is-visible {
        opacity: 1;
        pointer-events: auto;
      }

      .mobile-menu {
        display: inline-grid;
      }

      .topbar {
        padding: 0 18px;
      }

      .dashboard-grid,
      .split-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .profile-copy {
        display: none;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 620px) {
      .content,
      .footer-inner {
        width: min(100% - 32px, 1240px);
      }

      .topbar {
        min-height: 64px;
      }

      .breadcrumbs span,
      .breadcrumbs svg {
        display: none;
      }

      .status-pill {
        padding: 0 9px;
      }

      .status-pill .status-text {
        display: none;
      }

      .page-intro {
        display: block;
      }

      .page-intro h1 {
        margin-top: 8px;
        font-size: 27px;
      }

      .page-meta {
        margin-top: 16px;
      }

      .hero-panel {
        display: block;
      }

      .hero-copy {
        padding: 26px 22px;
      }

      .hero-copy h2 {
        font-size: 23px;
      }

      .hero-media,
      .hero-media img {
        min-height: 175px;
        height: 175px;
      }

      .hero-actions {
        width: 100%;
      }

      .hero-actions .button {
        width: 100%;
      }

      .metrics-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .section-heading {
        align-items: flex-start;
      }

      .module-row {
        grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
        gap: 11px;
        padding: 14px;
      }

      .module-status {
        grid-column: 2;
        justify-self: start;
      }

      .module-action {
        grid-column: 3;
        grid-row: 1 / span 2;
      }

      .module-copy small {
        white-space: normal;
      }

      .footer-inner {
        display: block;
        padding: 22px 0;
      }

      .footer-links {
        justify-content: flex-start;
        margin-top: 16px;
      }

      .toast {
        right: 16px;
        bottom: 16px;
        left: 16px;
        max-width: none;
      }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *,
      *::before,
      *::after {
        scroll-behavior: auto !important;
        transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
        animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="app-shell">
    <aside class="sidebar" id="sidebar">
      <a href="#overview" class="brand" aria-label="SIGRE - Visão geral">
        <span class="brand-mark">
          <i data-lucide="graduation-cap"></i>
        </span>

        <span>
          <strong class="brand-name">SIGRE</strong>
          <small class="brand-subtitle">Sistema integrado de gestão escolar</small>
        </span>
      </a>

      <div class="workspace-card">
        <span class="workspace-label">Área activa</span>
        <strong class="workspace-title">Direcção Municipal</strong>
        <span class="workspace-meta">Educação · Quessúa</span>
      </div>

      <nav class="primary-nav" aria-label="Navegação principal">
        <span class="nav-label">Gestão</span>

        <a href="#overview" class="nav-link active" aria-current="page">
          <i data-lucide="layout-dashboard"></i>
          <span>Visão geral</span>
        </a>

        <a href="#modules" class="nav-link">
          <i data-lucide="building-2"></i>
          <span>Escolas</span>
        </a>

        <a href="#staff" class="nav-link">
          <i data-lucide="users"></i>
          <span>Professores</span>
          <span class="nav-badge">32</span>
        </a>

        <a href="#modules" class="nav-link">
          <i data-lucide="layers"></i>
          <span>Turmas</span>
        </a>

        <a href="#reports" class="nav-link">
          <i data-lucide="bar-chart-3"></i>
          <span>Relatórios</span>
        </a>

        <span class="nav-label" style="margin-top: 22px;">Sistema</span>

        <a href="#settings" class="nav-link" data-toast="A área de definições está disponível no menu do utilizador.">
          <i data-lucide="settings"></i>
          <span>Definições</span>
        </a>
      </nav>

      <div class="sidebar-footer">
        <a href="#support" class="support-link">
          <i data-lucide="life-buoy"></i>
          <span>Centro de apoio</span>
        </a>

        <div class="sidebar-user">
          <span class="avatar">DM</span>
          <span>
            <strong>Director Municipal</strong>
            <small>Administrador</small>
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <div class="sidebar-overlay" id="sidebarOverlay"></div>

    <main class="main-shell">
      <header class="topbar">
        <div class="topbar-left">
          <button
            class="icon-button mobile-menu"
            id="menuToggle"
            type="button"
            aria-label="Abrir menu"
            aria-expanded="false"
          >
            <i data-lucide="menu"></i>
          </button>

          <div class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Localização">
            <span>SIGRE</span>
            <i data-lucide="chevron-right"></i>
            <strong>Visão geral</strong>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="topbar-actions">
          <button
            class="status-pill"
            type="button"
            data-toast="Existem 3 processos pendentes de homologação."
          >
            <i data-lucide="shield-check"></i>
            <span class="status-text">Homologações</span>
            <span class="status-counter">3</span>
          </button>

          <button
            class="icon-button"
            id="notificationsButton"
            type="button"
            aria-label="Abrir notificações"
            aria-expanded="false"
            aria-controls="notificationsPanel"
          >
            <i data-lucide="bell"></i>
            <span class="notification-dot"></span>
          </button>

          <button
            class="profile-trigger"
            id="profileButton"
            type="button"
            aria-expanded="false"
            aria-controls="profilePanel"
          >
            <span class="avatar">DM</span>

            <span class="profile-copy">
              <strong>Director Municipal</strong>
              <small>Administrador</small>
            </span>

            <i data-lucide="chevron-down"></i>
          </button>

          <div class="popover" id="notificationsPanel" hidden>
            <div class="popover-header">
              <strong>Notificações</strong>
              <small>Actividade recente do sistema</small>
            </div>

            <button class="popover-item" type="button" data-toast="A área de homologações será aberta.">
              <i data-lucide="shield-check"></i>
              <span>
                <strong>3 homologações pendentes</strong>
                <small>Requerem revisão da direcção</small>
              </span>
            </button>

            <button class="popover-item" type="button" data-toast="A configuração de turmas está pendente.">
              <i data-lucide="triangle-alert"></i>
              <span>
                <strong>Turmas ainda não configuradas</strong>
                <small>Complete o próximo passo do período lectivo</small>
              </span>
            </button>
          </div>

          <div class="popover" id="profilePanel" hidden>
            <div class="popover-header">
              <strong>Director Municipal</strong>
              <small>Administrador do sistema</small>
            </div>

            <button class="popover-item" type="button" data-toast="O perfil será aberto.">
              <i data-lucide="user-round"></i>
              <span>
                <strong>Meu perfil</strong>
                <small>Dados e permissões de acesso</small>
              </span>
            </button>

            <button class="popover-item" type="button" data-toast="Sessão terminada.">
              <i data-lucide="log-out"></i>
              <span>
                <strong>Terminar sessão</strong>
                <small>Sair da conta actual</small>
              </span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="content">
        <section class="page-intro" id="overview">
          <div>
            <span class="eyebrow">Painel de gestão</span>
            <h1>Bom dia, Director Municipal</h1>
            <p>Acompanhe o estado da rede escolar num único lugar.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="page-meta">
            <span class="sync-dot"></span>
            <span id="lastUpdated">Actualizado agora</span>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="hero-panel" aria-label="Próximo passo">
          <div class="hero-copy">
            <span class="eyebrow">Próximo passo</span>
            <h2>Prepare o novo período lectivo</h2>
            <p>Configure as turmas para activar os indicadores de acompanhamento.</p>

            <div class="hero-actions">
              <button
                class="button button-primary"
                type="button"
                data-toast="A configuração de turmas será aberta."
              >
                Configurar turmas
                <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right"></i>
              </button>

              <button
                class="button button-ghost"
                type="button"
                data-toast="Não existem outras pendências neste momento."
              >
                Ver pendências
                <i data-lucide="list-check"></i>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="hero-media">
            <img
              src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1503676260728-1c00da094a0b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85"
              alt="Sala de aula com estudantes"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section" aria-labelledby="indicators-title">
          <div class="section-heading">
            <div>
              <span class="eyebrow">Resumo</span>
              <h2 id="indicators-title">Indicadores principais</h2>
            </div>

            <button class="text-button" id="refreshButton" type="button">
              Actualizar
              <i data-lucide="refresh-cw"></i>
            </button>
          </div>

          <div class="metrics-grid">
            <article class="metric-card primary">
              <div class="metric-top">
                <span>Alunos</span>
                <span class="metric-icon">
                  <i data-lucide="graduation-cap"></i>
                </span>
              </div>

              <strong class="metric-value">0</strong>

              <div class="metric-bottom">
                <span class="metric-status">Sem registos activos</span>
                <button class="metric-link" type="button" data-toast="O módulo de alunos será aberto.">
                  Ver
                  <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right"></i>
                </button>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="metric-card">
              <div class="metric-top">
                <span>Turmas</span>
                <span class="metric-icon">
                  <i data-lucide="layers"></i>
                </span>
              </div>

              <strong class="metric-value">0</strong>

              <div class="metric-bottom">
                <span class="metric-status">Configuração pendente</span>
                <button class="metric-link" type="button" data-toast="A configuração de turmas será aberta.">
                  Configurar
                  <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right"></i>
                </button>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="metric-card">
              <div class="metric-top">
                <span>Escolas</span>
                <span class="metric-icon">
                  <i data-lucide="building-2"></i>
                </span>
              </div>

              <strong class="metric-value">1</strong>

              <div class="metric-bottom">
                <span class="metric-status">Escola registada</span>
                <button class="metric-link" type="button" data-toast="A lista de escolas será aberta.">
                  Ver
                  <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right"></i>
                </button>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="metric-card">
              <div class="metric-top">
                <span>Professores</span>
                <span class="metric-icon">
                  <i data-lucide="users"></i>
                </span>
              </div>

              <strong class="metric-value">32</strong>

              <div class="metric-bottom">
                <span class="metric-status">Registados no sistema</span>
                <button class="metric-link" type="button" data-toast="A lista de professores será aberta.">
                  Ver
                  <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right"></i>
                </button>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="metric-card">
              <div class="metric-top">
                <span>Presença média</span>
                <span class="metric-icon">
                  <i data-lucide="clipboard-check"></i>
                </span>
              </div>

              <strong class="metric-value">0%</strong>

              <div class="metric-bottom">
                <span class="metric-status">Sem dados disponíveis</span>
                <span class="state-badge neutral">Aguardando</span>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="metric-card">
              <div class="metric-top">
                <span>Alertas activos</span>
                <span class="metric-icon">
                  <i data-lucide="triangle-alert"></i>
                </span>
              </div>

              <strong class="metric-value">0</strong>

              <div class="metric-bottom">
                <span class="metric-status">Nenhum alerta crítico</span>
                <span class="state-badge success">Regular</span>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="dashboard-grid" aria-label="Monitorização">
          <article class="panel">
            <div class="panel-heading">
              <div>
                <span class="eyebrow">Monitorização</span>
